            <div xml:id="m-868fa033-a905-42ec-aa01-0d7b29a1f69e">
              <lg xml:id="m-4e1f1cef-feec-42c1-b475-2e146c0a0689">
                <l xml:id="m-6e81acb2-3710-465b-97e5-55f07c01e612" facs="#m-6d976739-f225-4c98-b6d4-a684c4a8bf50" label="text-like">Common of a Confessor Bishop. Vespers.</l><l xml:id="m-068da229-a45b-4e52-903a-a5753dfe4342" facs="#m-1994c5ba-8814-4bcd-a496-b5f7a9a41129" label="ambiguous">nsi</l><l xml:id="m-4ecc89aa-a081-4913-aea4-6eed57f787b6" facs="#m-84e2c846-809a-4bbd-a0c5-ba5b4e1dfa0d" label="text-like">At Magn.</l><l xml:id="m-c66812d9-5204-44d2-82ba-7041e4b89a13" facs="#m-6f94cb10-b2c9-4cf3-982b-e2904654873a" label="ambiguous">Ant. 1. D2</l><l xml:id="m-fb6a66f3-7c3b-44d8-9b79-ac20a82ab0fc" facs="#m-a4477df9-8cc5-4b77-bd55-5f2e58f99940" label="ambiguous">H</l><l xml:id="m-bc71e301-a2c0-4587-ad28-76ec251c405b" facs="#m-99617d76-9c1a-40c3-bda8-c98909e4b7d9" label="lyrics-like">-mávit é¬ um Dómi-nus, “ et orná-vit é¬ um:</l><l xml:id="m-3441c060-4d17-4d31-afed-38799369ac70" facs="#m-a836bd77-6f93-4743-902b-26ef33782a8e" label="lyrics-like">stó-lam gló-ri-ae indu-it é- um, et ad pórtas paradí¬</l><l xml:id="m-c55d1648-b870-420a-b8de-80c82876ecf2" facs="#m-89ea8fdc-e15d-4aaa-b169-34d181e25bca" label="lyrics-like">si coronávit é- um. T. P. Alle-lú-ia. E u o u a e¬</l><l xml:id="m-1becadb3-00d6-4aa1-9058-5059e0d06efb" facs="#m-90516bf2-83f0-411d-80a1-9599a7fd6892" label="lyrics-like">Cant. Magníficat. 1. Da. p. 207 or p. 213.</l><l xml:id="m-f53362ba-9be8-4210-a420-13fe7740777f" facs="#m-33522e61-73d1-4589-a244-3cb262a4b6d7" label="text-like">Prayer.</l><l xml:id="m-9d011914-a9e0-483b-847d-62c6dd705c41" facs="#m-e39811c6-ae62-4f4d-9bad-c4a344dd2ebd" label="lyrics-like">A, quaésumus omnípotens! solémnitas, * et devotiónem nobis</l><l xml:id="m-4a4de522-13cc-4dc7-8a89-c7195e9327b6" facs="#m-e4752cd0-c096-4c45-a626-af385ce88e77" label="lyrics-like">1 Deus: t ut beáti N. Confessó¬</l><l xml:id="m-2f51d810-e8c0-4789-8ee5-452fc1e77b7d" facs="#m-6afdc38e-7aab-4ace-990d-d5a9961a4d25" label="lyrics-like">áugeat et salútem. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-9b5212e7-83cc-4343-bb03-848bec2ba1c4" facs="#m-d8ba0193-2886-4038-b084-7e5710997188" label="lyrics-like">ris tui atque Pontíficis veneránda</l><l xml:id="m-3c6677f4-ac9f-444b-a56a-1294bc95f765" facs="#m-2a3ffbbf-2aa8-4624-bac0-7d9dbadd0e29" label="text-like">Another Prayer.</l><l xml:id="m-343e2109-138e-4338-9ce0-6a60259c93fd" facs="#m-5852ba8e-9644-485c-8e23-df7db3da81e1" label="lyrics-like">«xáudi, quaésumus Dómine, pre-] digne méruit famulári, ejus inter¬</l><l xml:id="m-fcabc3f3-df05-44cd-845f-fdee1273579f" facs="#m-3aa0678c-0249-4d35-9474-43a59fa3067a" label="lyrics-like">U ces nostras, quas in beáti N.</l><l xml:id="m-f9d132ff-15f8-4504-b379-d5baffeb832b" facs="#m-35ea30ad-9cdd-4062-b2a9-d3ef1ebed4b2" label="lyrics-like">cedéntibus méritis, * ab ómnibus</l><l xml:id="m-97e3cba5-4c7b-4291-a2d7-96034961ed2f" facs="#m-bfc93a3e-230c-4328-837d-0138d557f931" label="lyrics-like">Confessóris tui atque Pontificis so¬</l><l xml:id="m-5a6a4b0e-af1a-4c84-b684-79edb41ae8c4" facs="#m-d3697c83-c8fb-4a0b-8f8f-3c52929790d0" label="lyrics-like">nos absólve peccátis. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-e328ffa1-9dba-4784-bc0a-4d4657be6d1b" facs="#m-87551b20-473a-4fab-af28-6e17eec444d1" label="lyrics-like">lemnitáte deférimus: t et qui tibi</l><l xml:id="m-1d281bc4-9abd-4b63-99e9-0993377436f7" facs="#m-ee03e5f9-ecb9-4b7b-8ac5-8a239c7ab7d7" label="text-like">The following Antiphon for the Magnificat. at second Vespers is said only</l><l xml:id="m-0e517f90-7253-43cd-9a5c-b7c673177cac" facs="#m-2af82882-43ea-40fe-93a6-92b1fd0fca39" label="text-like">for Sovereign Pontiffs. If a Commemoration is to be made of another</l><l xml:id="m-09f19890-f367-4335-86ee-afca17ab281f" facs="#m-897a99a9-9b09-413a-9369-75f684f6bfd6" label="lyrics-like">Sovereign Pontiff, the Antiphon Amávit. is taken, as above.</l><l xml:id="m-1200557f-c7f4-4d09-8cdc-27f6ccf87639" facs="#m-46873eab-d0f2-4a61-baef-5c38e1e4b7db" label="text-like">At Magn.</l><l xml:id="m-6093b8d8-31b8-40cf-8d36-c6771ff8f784" facs="#m-cede1cc7-50b1-433a-a437-775770ed8894" label="ambiguous">Ant. 1.f</l><l xml:id="m-5cacb3bc-cdca-471b-9056-9cdc2c8a179f" facs="#m-fc246f7a-983f-4292-a02e-e35ff9f085e4" label="lyrics-like">DUM ésset súmmus Pónti-fex, * ter-réna non mé¬</l><l xml:id="m-e0df2f57-b866-4e2f-b5f2-f0011422045b" facs="#m-a81102da-2bb5-4933-a4cd-9dacb575525d" label="lyrics-like">tu-it: sed ad caelésti-a régna glo-ri-ósus migrá-vit.</l><l xml:id="m-776dcc51-3cee-49dc-8911-a553e8a9f965" facs="#m-4b2970a6-8058-4019-a0b5-6598a2a687e1" label="lyrics-like">T. P. Alle-lú-ia. E u o u a e. Cant. Magníficat. I. f. p. 207, or p. 213.</l><l xml:id="m-af9e029a-3f69-41e3-8205-64cd9c2c8943" facs="#m-071ff0c7-1cfe-4daf-9e91-62ebb6a09302" label="text-like">If a Commemoration is to be made of another Confessor Bishop whose</l><l xml:id="m-472daef9-c8ee-4e83-b2c8-988d3d148a21" facs="#m-0fc08c0b-52d2-4db1-a339-34b99a0cfff1" label="lyrics-like">omce has the Antiphon Amávit, the following Antiphon is said for the</l><l xml:id="m-06ef0d22-e416-4690-99ca-04ca84809cb7" facs="#m-2b11d3f3-e1eb-4fd7-b0aa-69b9242aa1cb" label="ambiguous">Commemoration:</l><l xml:id="m-180bb5c8-879d-4a28-84d3-812675f92554" facs="#m-91eb9340-a27c-4831-8d19-6df998533973" label="ambiguous">Ant.</l><l xml:id="m-8c8a5ea3-ceae-40e4-8e18-f736b6d61278" facs="#m-47355f0f-05a7-4a71-851c-48f82e3306ab" label="ambiguous">1.»</l><l xml:id="m-dde64733-c9ab-44c2-8395-9229059109db" facs="#m-66af3795-d16f-4ec2-99a7-d722eb7c19b1" label="lyrics-like">U- ge, * sérve bóne et fidé- lis. qui-a in páu¬</l><l xml:id="m-1f81be95-94d2-4221-b1c0-883f8a5a4e09" facs="#m-d96acc59-a371-4882-ade2-55ca9a44b7a3" label="ambiguous">C</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>